     "t": "p",
     "html": "Those with acne-prone skin can suffer from both non-inflammatory (breakouts) and inflammatory (red, tender papules or cystic lesions). Although acne is more common for individuals with oily skin, it is not tied to any one skin type. Frequent triggers for this condition include incorrect product usage, hormones, diet, medication, genetics, stress and environmental factors. To help target this skin concern, the following services and products might be right for you."
    }
